      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli ŵaŵendile kuti akole mwenye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samuele piŵacekulwipe, ŵaŵisile ŵanace ŵacalume kuti aŵe ŵakulamulila cilambo ca Isalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanace jwakwe jwamkulungwa jwaliji Yoweli nipo jwamnandi jwaliji Abiya. Jemanjaji ŵalamulaga ku Belesheba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo ŵanacewo nganakola ndamo syambone mpela sya baba ŵawo, m'malo mwakwe ŵapocelaga mbote sya cilo soni nganalamulaga magambo cenene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko acakulungwakulungwa ŵa mu Isalaeli ŵasongene nipo ŵajile ku Lama kuŵatamaga Samuele, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nipo piŵayice kweleko ŵamsalile jwalakwejo kuti, “Alole, ŵalakwe acekulwipe sambano, soni ŵanace ŵawo ŵangali ndamo syambone mpela sya ŵalakwe. Sambano tukusaka kwaŵenda kuti atupe mwenye jwakuti atulamulileje, mpela mwakutendela mu yilambo yine.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.17.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Det 17:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maloŵe gelega gakuti, “Atupe mwenye kuti atulamulileje” nganigamsangalasya Samuele. Myoyo jwalakwejo jwapopesile kwa Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ŵamjanjile jwalakwejo kuti, “Myipikanile yosope yakumsalila ŵanduyo. Jemanjajo ngakumkana m'mwejo nambo akungana une. Ngakusaka kuti une mbe mwenye jwawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutyocela lisiku linakopwesye jemanjajo kutyoka mcilambo ca Iguputo mpaka sambano jino, yitendo yawo yiŵele yakungana une nipo aŵele ali mkujitumicila milungu jine. Ni sambano akumkana ni m'mwejo ŵakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambano myipikanile yakusaka jemanjajo, nambo mwakalamusye mnope ni kwasalila ya ndamo syakwe sya mwenye jutacalamulilajo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samuele ŵasalile ŵandu ŵiŵaŵendaga kuti akole mwenye ŵala yosope yiŵasasile AMBUJE kwa ŵelewo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakwe ŵatite, “Ayi ni yele yitacimtendelaga mwenye jwenujo: tacimsumula ŵanagwenu ŵacalume kuti aŵe asilikali ŵa ngondo, ŵane taciŵa ali mkutumicila pa yigeleta yakwe ya ngondo, ŵane pa mahaci ga ngondo soni ŵane taciŵa ŵakuwutuka pasogolo ma mageletago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵane mwa jemanjajo tacatenda kuti aŵe ŵakulamulila ŵa ngondo ŵakulolela ŵandu 1,000, ŵane ŵakulolela ŵandu makumi msano. Ŵanagwenu ŵacalumewo tacilimaga mu mgunda mwa mwenyejo, kugowola mbeju sya mwenyejo, ni kusyana yida yakwe ya ngondo ni yisyano ya pa mageleta ga ngondo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵanace ŵenu ŵacakongwe tacimpanganyicisyaga mwenyejo mawuta gakununjila mnope ni kutelekaga yakulya ni kupanganya mkate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyejo tacimsumula migunda jenu ja cajila, migunda jenu ja mipeleya ni ja yisogosi yakupanganyicisya mawuta ga olifi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " kwisa soni migunda jenu ja yisogosi ni kujipeleka kwa nduna syakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tacisumula ca likumi ca mbeju sya tiligu jwenu ni mipeleya ni kwikamulisyaga masengo gakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tacimsumula ŵamasengo ŵenu ŵacalume ni ŵacakongwe. Tacimsumula soni ng'ombe syenu syakwimbala pamo ni acibulu ni kwikamulisyaga masengo ga jwalakwejo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tacisumula ca likumi ca ngondolo syenu nipo jemanja timciŵa acikapolo ŵakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Patijiciyika ndaŵi jelejo, jemanja timcilila mwakutesya canasa ligongo lya mwenye jumlisagulile mwacimsyenejo, nambo AMBUJE ngasamjanga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo ŵanduwo ŵakanile kupikanila maloŵe ga Samuele. Jemanjajo ŵatite kuti, “Iyayi! Uwe tukusaka mwenye jwakuti atulamulileje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tukusosa kuti nombe uwe tuŵe mpela mitundu jine ja ŵandu, nambo soni mwenye jwetu atulamuleje, kutulongolela ni kutuputila ngondo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samuele piŵapikene maloŵe gosope ga ŵanduwo, ŵajile kukwasalila AMBUJE yosope yiŵaŵecete ŵandu yila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambano AMBUJE ŵamsalile Samuele kuti, “Myipikanile yakuŵecetayo, nipo mwape mwenye.” Myoyo Samuele ŵasalile Aisalaeli kuti awujile kumangwawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
